.TH VAROOM 1
.SH NAME
varoom \- oval-track racing game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/varoom
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Varoom
is a oval-track racing game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Steer and accelerate on an oval track against AI cars under a chase camera.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Left / a
Steer left
.TP
.B Right / d
Steer right
.TP
.B Up / w
Accelerate
.TP
.B Down / s
Brake/slow
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/varoom.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
